{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Find and take object, check its properties, do specific task; if not found, move randomly or scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveToGetObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectWeight    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectColor    /> <Action ID = ProcessObjectTask    /> <Action ID = MoveToScanArea    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    /> <Action ID = MoveRandomly    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsAreaScanned    />",
